          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 00 NW\t\tHEMEL HEMPSTEAD\t\tLONDON ROAD Bourne End 894/10/194 Hay Lodge 17/02/77\t\t\t\t\t\t(formerly listed as London Road Lodge to north of Westbrook Hey) II Lodge. Early to mid C19 within C20 alterations and extensions. Painted brickwork beneath a tiled roof, renewed in original pattern of alternate bands of plain and fish-scale tiling. Cottage Orne style, with deep roof overhang supported on unsawn tree trunks, with rustic bracing to the eaves. Single storey, with hipped roof and central chimney stack, remodelled late C20.Lattice casement windows, those to the principal elevation with transoms. Listing NGR: TL0304106039"
    }
